<title>ITALY: RUGBY UNION-WALES BEAT ITALY 31-22.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-WALES BEAT ITALY 31-22.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wales beat Italy 31-22 (halftime</p>
<p>18-9) in an international rugby union match at the Olympic</p>
<p>stadium on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers -</p>
<p>Italy - tries: Ivan Francescato. Penalties: Diego Dominguez</p>
<p>5. Conversion: Dominguez.</p>
<p>Wales - tries: Daffydd James, Gareth Thomas 2. Penalties:</p>
<p>Neil Jenkins 4. Conversion: Jenkins (2)</p>
